{"id":"879b42e91247e55b","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem.md","title":"Degree Spectrum Characterization Theorem","display":"thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem — Degree Spectrum Characterization Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem"],"display":"thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem — Degree Spectrum Characterization Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-degree-spectrum]]","[[68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation]]","[[68-df-turing-degree]]","[[68-df-computable-structure]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Local consequence of relation-spectrum and intrinsic-computability definitions; not in supplied book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem — Degree Spectrum Characterization Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93be4ecb17896d81\" href=\"?note=93be4ecb17896d81\" title=\"68-df-degree-spectrum\">68-df-degree-spectrum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e050274b891eb53\" href=\"?note=5e050274b891eb53\" title=\"68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation\">68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"41bf4c1fd4079b59\" href=\"?note=41bf4c1fd4079b59\" title=\"68-df-computable-structure\">68-df-computable-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local consequence of relation-spectrum and intrinsic-computability definitions; not in supplied book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D_A^n\">\\(R\\subseteq D_A^n\\)</span> 是额外关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)},\\operatorname{Code}_n,\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\deg\">\\(\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)},\\operatorname{Code}_n,\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\deg\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\">\\(\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)=\\{\\deg(\\varnothing)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)=\\{\\deg(\\varnothing)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地直接推导。code_n 是带递归像的可计算单射，因此 n 元关系 S 递归，当且仅当 Code_n(S) 递归，当且仅当其度是 deg(∅)。将此逐一应用于所有可计算副本中的坐标像，得到 IntrComp 当且仅当 DegSpec_c⊆{deg(∅)}；Hypothesis 的可计算副本存在性使此谱非空，故子集关系等价于等号。旧式使用任意副本谱并且省略存在性，结论不成立：无可计算副本时 IntrComp 真空成立而 DegSpec_c=∅；任意副本还允许非可计算重编号。此推导依据本地定义，不能据此把外部定义来源升级为原书核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-degree-spectrum","status":"resolved","id":"93be4ecb17896d81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-spectrum]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation","status":"resolved","id":"5e050274b891eb53","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-computable-structure","status":"resolved","id":"41bf4c1fd4079b59","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-computable-structure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D_A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)},\\operatorname{Code}_n,\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\deg","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)=\\{\\deg(\\varnothing)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2102,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem|thm-degree-spectrum-characterization-theorem — Degree Spectrum Characterization Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["93be4ecb17896d81","5e050274b891eb53","43fcc2f44ce938e0","41bf4c1fd4079b59"]}